# Changelog

## [0.2.2] - 2026-10-23

- pass a bounded `:max_body_size` (default 16 MB, configurable via the
  `max_body_size` option of `Consul.Connection.new/2`) to
  `Tesla.Middleware.DecompressResponse`. Tesla >= 1.18.3 (CVE-2026-48594)
  requires it and raises `ArgumentError` on every response without it.
  The cap is only enforced on Tesla >= 1.18.3; older versions ignore it

## [0.2.1] - 2025-03-03

- fix store_index/2 for handling errors

## [0.2.0] - 2022-11-18

- Added handling of edge cases when using blocking queries
- Added relying on consul's default wait time (which is 5 minutes) when passing `wait: true`
- Extracted index caching from middleware to `Consul.IndexStore` module, which is started on application start instead of `Tesla.Middleware.ConsulWatch`

## [0.1.6] - 2022-05-10

### Added

- Ability to specify the Tesla adapter. Defaults to `nil`
